<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CommitMate | 완벽한 행동 설계</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0e0f11;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --text-muted: #555;
            --danger: #f87171;
            --green: #34d399;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg); color: #fff; overflow-x: hidden; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }

        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; }

        /* ── Header ── */
        header {
            height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky; top: 0;
            background: rgba(14,15,17,0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px); z-index: 100;
        }
        .header-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .logo { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #fff; }
        .logo span { color: var(--danger); }

        nav { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
            padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 8px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .nav-link:hover { color: #fff; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }

        .btn-signup-sm {
            background: #fff; color: #0e0f11;
            padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-signup-sm:hover { background: #e0e0e0; }

        /* ── Hero ── */
        .hero { padding: 100px 0 80px; text-align: center; }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(248,113,113,0.08);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25);
            padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 100px;
            font-size: 12px; color: var(--danger); font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .hero-badge::before {
            content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px;
            background: var(--danger); border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 72px);
            font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -2px;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .hero h1 span { color: var(--danger); }

        .hero p {
            color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 17px;
            max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 48px; line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .btn-cta {
            background: var(--danger); color: #fff;
            padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-cta:hover { background: #f95e5e; transform: translateY(-2px); }

        /* ── Dashboard Mockup ── */
        .mockup-wrap {
            max-width: 960px; margin: 72px auto 0;
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px; gap: 16px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .main-card {
            background: #111214;
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px;
        }

        .card-header {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .card-header h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .card-header p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .countdown { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--danger); letter-spacing: 0.5px; }

        .task-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
            padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
        }
        .task-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

        .check-box {
            width: 20px; height: 20px;
            border: 1.5px solid #2a2d33; border-radius: 6px;
            flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .check-box.done { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); }

        .task-text { font-size: 13px; color: #bbb; flex: 1; }
        .task-text.done { color: #3a5a42; text-decoration: line-through; }
        .task-fine { font-size: 11px; color: var(--danger); font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }

        /* 사이드 카드 */
        .side-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }

        .glass-panel {
            background: #111214;
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px;
        }

        .panel-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 8px; }

        .danger-amount {
            font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--danger); letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .penalty-bar {
            height: 3px; background: #222; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .penalty-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--danger); width: 65%; }

        .panel-sub { font-size: 11px; color: #3a3a3a; }

        .feed-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            font-size: 12px; color: #555; padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
        }
        .feed-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }

        .avatar {
            width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .feed-name { color: #aaa; font-weight: 600; }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        footer {
            padding: 60px 0; text-align: center;
            color: #2a2a2a; font-size: 12px;
            border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="container header-inner">
        <div class="logo">Commit<span>Mate</span>.</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#" class="nav-link">사용법</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-link">커뮤니티</a>
            <a href="/login-form" class="nav-link">로그인</a>
            <a href="signup-form" class="btn-signup-sm">회원가입</a>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-badge">현재 2,491개의 팀이 목표를 지키고 있습니다</div>
        <h1>의지가 흔들린다면<br><span>지갑</span>을 거세요.</h1>
        <p>투명한 장부 관리, 자동 벌금 정산, 강력한 커뮤니티.<br>당신의 꾸준함을 시스템으로 완성합니다.</p>
        <a href="signup-form" class="btn-cta">지금 무료로 시작하기</a>

        <!-- Dashboard Mockup -->
        <div class="mockup-wrap">
            <div class="main-card">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <div>
                        <h3>오늘의 미션</h3>
                        <p>2026년 5월 11일 월요일</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="countdown">마감까지 02:41:09</span>
                </div>

                <div class="task-list">
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="check-box done">
                            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0d1f16" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="task-text done">아침 7시 기상 및 오운완 인증</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="check-box"></div>
                        <span class="task-text">기술 블로그 포스팅 1개 업로드</span>
                        <span class="task-fine">₩5,000</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="check-box"></div>
                        <span class="task-text">리액트 공식 문서 3챕터 정독</span>
                        <span class="task-fine">₩3,000</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="side-card">
                <div class="glass-panel">
                    <div class="panel-label">TOTAL UNPAID</div>
                    <div class="danger-amount">₩8,000</div>
                    <div class="penalty-bar"><div class="penalty-fill"></div></div>
                    <div class="panel-sub">어제보다 미완수 확률이 12% 높습니다.</div>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-panel" style="flex: 1;">
                    <div class="panel-label" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">LIVE FEED</div>
                    <div class="feed-item">
                        <div class="avatar" style="background:#1c2e24; color:#34d399;">김</div>
                        <span><span class="feed-name">김민수</span>님이 미션을 완료했습니다.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feed-item">
                        <div class="avatar" style="background:#2a1010; color:#f87171;">이</div>
                        <span><span class="feed-name">이영희</span>님이 벌금 ₩5,000 적립..</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feed-item">
                        <div class="avatar" style="background:#0c2236; color:#7aa2c8;">박</div>
                        <span><span class="feed-name">박준형</span>님이 인증샷을 공유했습니다.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>COMMITMATE — NO MORE EXCUSES. JUST RESULTS.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>